{"step_index":195,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-15T11:16:57Z","thinking":"Regular user actions are correctly restricted, confirmed by 403 Forbidden responses for deletion and audio upload. Admin actions, conversely, are permitted: audio upload results in a 200 OK, and deletion results in a 204 No Content. Focusing on the frontend, the goal is to make a modern frontend, which includes addressing access control issues.\n\n\nFocusing on the frontend, the project will integrate chatbot functionality capable of answering questions about books, including plot details, characters, and quantitative information. The interface will be updated to include an audio player component, enabling users to listen to audiobooks directly on the book detail pages. The initial design will include a modern dark glassmorphic theme with specific color accents, smooth fonts, and polished UI components like blur panels and interactive hover effects. A top navigation bar will integrate a brand logo and a live search input for instant book filtering.\n\n\nThe interface will feature a user profile badge displaying avatar, name, and role with visual indicators for admin or regular user status. Admin actions are consolidated into quick-action buttons for book management, including book creation, PDF uploads, and batch uploads. A hero header will present dynamic counters for total books, audiobooks, genres, and the AI assistant status, providing key statistics at a glance.\n\n\nThe interface will provide several key components for audiobooks. An audio player bar at the bottom of the screen will appear when an audio file is available, complete with playback controls, progress bar, speed controls, and volume adjustments. Admin users will have additional options to upload audio files or delete books through modal confirmations. Reader Modal will be available, which includes PDF and Text Reader modes.\n\n\nReader modal will now support distraction-free typography with font-size controls and a dark/sepia mode, with a close button and Esc key listener. Admin will use the \"Yangi Kitob Qo'shish\" modal to enter Title, Author, Genre, Description, with file dropzones for PDF and audio files/URL. Admin can use the \"Audio Kitob Biriktirish\" modal to attach audio files or URL, after selecting book title. The interactive AI librarian chatbot widget will be added with suggested prompts and a responsive interface. A modern login/register process with an interactive SVG Avatar is retained.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"{% load static %}\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"uz\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>SmartLibrary AI | Zamonaviy Kutubxona va Audio Kitoblar Portali</title>\n  \n  <!-- Google Fonts & FontAwesome -->\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css\">\n  \n  <style>\n    :root {\n      --bg-dark: #0a0914;\n      --bg-card: rgba(22, 20, 38, 0.75);\n      --bg-card-hover: rgba(30, 27, 52, 0.9);\n      --panel-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n      --panel-border-hover: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.4);\n      --primary: #8b5cf6;\n      --primary-hover: #7c3aed;\n      --primary-glow: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.35);\n      --secondary: #03dac6;\n      --secondary-glow: rgba(3, 218, 198, 0.3);\n      --accent-pink: #ec4899;\n      --accent-amber: #f59e0b;\n      --text-main: #f8fafc;\n      --text-muted: #94a3b8;\n      --danger: #ef4444;\n      --success: #10b981;\n      --font: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;\n    }\n\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: var(--font); }\n\n    body {\n      background: var(--bg-dark);\n      background-image: \n        radial-gradient(circle at 10% 10%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.12) 0%, transparent 45%),\n        radial-gradient(circle at 90% 85%, rgba(3, 218, 198, 0.08) 0%, transparent 45%),\n        radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.04) 0%, transparent 60%);\n      background-attachment: fixed;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      overflow-x: hidden;\n      padding-bottom: 90px; /* space for audio player bar */\n    }\n\n    /* HEADER & NAVIGATION */\n    header {\n      padding: 1rem 2rem;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--panel-border);\n      backdrop-filter: blur(20px);\n      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);\n      background: rgba(10, 9, 20, 0.85);\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      align-items: center;\n      position: sticky;\n      top: 0;\n      z-index: 100;\n      gap: 1.5rem;\n    }\n\n    .brand {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 0.75rem;\n      text-decoration: none;\n      color: inherit;\n    }\n\n    .brand-logo-icon {\n      width: 42px;\n      height: 42px;\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary) 0%, #ec4899 100%);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      color: #fff;\n      font-size: 1.25rem;\n      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px var(--primary-glow);\n    }\n\n    .brand-text h1 {\n      font-size: 1.25rem;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      letter-spacing: -0.5px;\n      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff 0%, #cbd5e1 100%);\n      -webkit-background-clip: text;\n      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\n    }\n\n    .brand-text span {\n      font-size: 0.7rem;\n      color: var(--secondary);\n      font-weight: 700;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n    }\n\n    /* SEARCH BAR IN HEADER */\n    .header-search {\n      flex: 1;\n      max-width: 480px;\n      position: relative;\n    }\n\n    .header-search i {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 14px;\n      top: 50%;\n      transform: translateY(-50%);\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n      font-size: 0.9rem;\n    }\n\n    .header-search input {\n      width: 100%;\n      padding: 0.65rem 1rem 0.65rem 2.5rem;\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\n      border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);\n      border-radius: 25px;\n      color: #fff;\n      font-size: 0.85rem;\n      outline: none;\n      transition: all 0.3s ease;\n    }\n\n    .header-search input:focus {\n      border-color: var(--primary);\n      background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08);\n      box-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--primary-glow);\n    }\n\n    /* USER & ADMIN ACTIONS */\n    .header-actions {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 0.75rem;\n    }\n\n    .btn-nav {\n      display: inline-flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 0.5rem;\n      padding: 0.55rem 1.1rem;\n      font-size: 0.82rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      border-radius: 20px;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      border: 1px solid transparent;\n      transition: all 0.25s ease;\n      text-decoration: none;\n    }\n\n    .btn-nav-primary {\n      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary) 0%, var(--primary-hover) 100%);\n      color: #fff;\n      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px var(--primary-glow);\n    }\n\n    .btn-nav-primary:hover {\n      transform: translateY(-1px);\n      box-shadow: 0 6px 20px var(--primary-glow);\n    }\n\n    .btn-nav-secondary {\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      border-color: var(--panel-border);\n    }\n\n    .btn-nav-secondary:hover {\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n      border-color: var(--primary);\n    }\n\n    .user-pill {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 0.6rem;\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\n      border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);\n      padding: 0.4rem 0.85rem;\n      border-radius: 30px;\n      font-size: 0.82rem;\n    }\n\n    .user-role-badge {\n      font-size: 0.68rem;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      padding: 2px 7px;\n      border-radius: 10px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    .user-role-badge.admin {\n      background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.2);\n      color: #f87171;\n      border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.4);\n    }\n\n    .user-role-badge.user {\n      background: rgba(3, 218, 198, 0.2);\n      color: var(--secondary);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(3, 218, 198, 0.4);\n    }\n\n    /* MAIN CONTAINER */\n    .main-container {\n      max-width: 1300px;\n      width: 100%;\n      margin: 1.5rem auto;\n      padding: 0 1.5rem;\n      flex: 1;\n    }\n\n    /* HERO STATS BAR */\n    .hero-stats-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));\n      gap: 1rem;\n      margin-bottom: 2rem;\n    }\n\n    .stat-card {\n      background: var(--bg-card);\n      border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);\n      border-radius: 16px;\n      padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 1.2rem;\n      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\n      transition: all 0.3s ease;\n    }\n\n    .stat-card:hover {\n      border-color: var(--panel-border-hover);\n      transform: translateY(-2px);\n    }\n\n    .stat-icon {\n      width: 50px;\n      height: 50px;\n      border-radius: 14px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      font-size: 1.4rem;\n    }\n\n    .stat-icon.books { background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15); color: var(--primary); }\n    .stat-icon.audio { background: rgba(3, 218, 198, 0.15); color: var(--secondary); }\n    .stat-icon.genres { background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.15); color: var(--accent-amber); }\n    .stat-icon.ai { background: rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.15); color: var(--accent-pink); }\n\n    .stat-data h3 {\n      font-size: 1.5rem;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      color: #fff;\n    }\n\n    .stat-data p {\n      font-size: 0.78rem;\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n      font-weight: 600;\n    }\n\n    /* ADMIN ACTION TOOLBAR */\n    .admin-toolbar {\n      display: none;\n      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1) 0%, rgba(3, 218, 198, 0.05) 100%);\n      border: 1px dashed var(--primary);\n      border-radius: 16px;\n      padding: 1rem 1.5rem;\n      margin-bottom: 2rem;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      flex-wrap: wrap;\n      gap: 1rem;\n    }\n\n    .admin-toolbar-title {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 0.75rem;\n      font-size: 0.95rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: #fff;\n    }\n\n    .admin-toolbar-title i {\n      color: var(--primary);\n    }\n\n    .admin-toolbar-btns {\n      display: flex;\n      gap: 0.75rem;\n      flex-wrap: wrap;\n    }\n\n    /* GENRE FILTER PILLS */\n    .filter-wrapper {\n      margin-bottom: 1.75rem;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      gap: 1rem;\n      flex-wrap: wrap;\n    }\n\n    .genre-pills {\n      display: flex;\n      gap: 0.5rem;\n      overflow-x: auto;\n      padding-bottom: 6px;\n      scrollbar-width: thin;\n      flex: 1;\n    }\n\n    .genre-pill {\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);\n      border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n      font-size: 0.8rem;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      padding: 0.45rem 1rem;\n      border-radius: 20px;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n      transition: all 0.25s ease;\n    }\n\n    .genre-pill:hover {\n      color: #fff;\n      border-color: var(--primary);\n    }\n\n    .genre-pill.active {\n      background: var(--primary);\n      color: #fff;\n      border-color: var(--primary);\n      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px var(--primary-glow);\n    }\n\n    .audio-filter-toggle {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 0.5rem;\n      background: rgba(3, 218, 198, 0.08);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(3, 218, 198, 0.3);\n      color: var(--secondary);\n      padding: 0.45rem 1rem;\n      border-radius: 20px;\n      font-size: 0.8rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      transition: all 0.25s ease;\n    }\n\n    .audio-filter-toggle.active {\n      background: var(--secondary);\n      color: #0a0914;\n      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px var(--secondary-glow);\n    }\n\n    /* BOOKS GRID & CARDS */\n    .books-section-title {\n      font-size: 1.25rem;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n    }\n\n    .books-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(290px, 1fr));\n      gap: 1.5rem;\n    }\n\n    .book-card {\n      background: var(--bg-card);\n      border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);\n      border-radius: 18px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\n      transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);\n      position: relative;\n    }\n\n    .book-card:hover {\n      transform: translateY(-6px);\n      border-color: var(--panel-border-hover);\n      box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), 0 0 25px var(--primary-glow);\n    }\n\n    .book-card-banner {\n      height: 110px;\n      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25) 0%, rgba(3, 218, 198, 0.15) 100%);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: flex-end;\n      padding: 1rem;\n      position: relative;\n    }\n\n    .book-icon-badge {\n      width: 48px;\n      height: 48px;\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      background: rgba(10, 9, 20, 0.9);\n      border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      font-size: 1.4rem;\n      color: var(--secondary);\n      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n      margin-bottom: -15px;\n    }\n\n    .book-card-badges {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 10px;\n      right: 10px;\n      display: flex;\n      gap: 5px;\n    }\n\n    .badge-tag {\n      font-size: 0.68rem;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      padding: 3px 8px;\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);\n    }\n\n    .badge-tag.audio {\n      background: rgba(3, 218, 198, 0.2);\n      color: var(--secondary);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(3, 218, 198, 0.4);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 4px;\n    }\n\n    .badge-tag.pdf {\n      background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.2);\n      color: #f87171;\n      border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.4);\n    }\n\n    .book-card-body {\n      padding: 1.5rem 1.25rem 1rem 1.25rem;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      flex: 1;\n    }\n\n    .book-title {\n      font-size: 1.05rem;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      color: #fff;\n      margin-bottom: 0.35rem;\n      line-height: 1.4;\n      display: -webkit-box;\n      -webkit-line-clamp: 2;\n      -webkit-box-orient: vertical;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n\n    .book-author {\n      font-size: 0.8rem;\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 0.35rem;\n    }\n\n    .book-genre-label {\n      align-self: flex-start;\n      font-size: 0.72rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: var(--primary);\n      background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2);\n      padding: 2px 8px;\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n    }\n\n    .book-desc {\n      font-size: 0.8rem;\n      color: #cbd5e1;\n      line-height: 1.5;\n      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;\n      display: -webkit-box;\n      -webkit-line-clamp: 3;\n      -webkit-box-orient: vertical;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      flex: 1;\n    }\n\n    /* CARD ACTION BUTTONS */\n    .book-card-actions {\n      display: flex;\n      gap: 0.5rem;\n      align-items: center;\n      border-top: 1px solid var(--panel-border);\n      padding-top: 0.85rem;\n    }\n\n    .btn-card {\n      flex: 1;\n      display: inline-flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      gap: 0.4rem;\n      padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;\n      border-radius: 10px;\n      font-size: 0.8rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      border: none;\n      transition: all 0.25s ease;\n      text-decoration: none;\n    }\n\n    .btn-read {\n      background: rgba(3, 218, 198, 0.12);\n      color: var(--secondary);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(3, 218, 198, 0.25);\n    }\n\n    .btn-read:hover {\n      background: var(--secondary);\n      color: #0a0914;\n    }\n\n    .btn-listen {\n      background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15);\n      color: #a78bfa;\n      border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3);\n    }\n\n    .btn-listen:hover {\n      background: var(--primary);\n      color: #fff;\n    }\n\n    .btn-admin-action {\n      padding: 0.5rem;\n      width: 36px;\n      height: 36px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      border-radius: 10px;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      border: 1px solid transparent;\n      transition: all 0.25s ease;\n    }\n\n    .btn-add-audio-admin {\n      background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.15);\n      color: var(--accent-amber);\n      border-color: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.3);\n    }\n\n    .btn-add-audio-admin:hover {\n      background: var(--accent-amber);\n      color: #0a0914;\n    }\n\n    .btn-delete-admin {\n      background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.15);\n      color: var(--danger);\n      border-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.3);\n    }\n\n    .btn-delete-admin:hover {\n      background: var(--danger);\n      color: #fff;\n    }\n\n    /* PERSISTENT FLOATING AUDIO PLAYER BAR */\n    .audio-player-bar {\n      position: fixed;\n      bottom: 0;\n      left: 0;\n      width: 100%;\n      background: rgba(15, 13, 28, 0.95);\n      backdrop-filter: blur(25px);\n      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(25px);\n      border-top: 1px solid var(--panel-border-hover);\n      padding: 0.75rem 2rem;\n      display: none;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      gap: 1.5rem;\n      z-index: 999;\n      box-shadow: 0 -10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);\n      animation: slideUp 0.3s ease;\n    }\n\n    @keyframes slideUp {\n      from { transform: translateY(100%); }\n      to { transform: translateY(0); }\n    }\n\n    .player-track-info {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 1rem;\n      min-width: 200px;\n      max-width: 280px;\n    }\n\n    .player-cover {\n      width: 44px;\n      height: 44px;\n      border-radius: 10px;\n      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary) 0%, var(--secondary) 100%);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      color: #fff;\n      font-size: 1.2rem;\n      flex-shrink: 0;\n    }\n\n    .player-titles h4 {\n      font-size: 0.85rem;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      color: #fff;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      text-overflow: ellipsis;\n    }\n\n    .player-titles p {\n      font-size: 0.72rem;\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n    }\n\n    .player-controls-center {\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 0.4rem;\n      flex: 1;\n      max-width: 550px;\n    }\n\n    .player-buttons {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 1rem;\n    }\n\n    .btn-player-ctrl {\n      background: none;\n      border: none;\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n      font-size: 1rem;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      transition: all 0.2s;\n    }\n\n    .btn-player-ctrl:hover {\n      color: #fff;\n      transform: scale(1.1);\n    }\n\n    .btn-play-pause {\n      width: 42px;\n      height: 42px;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      background: #fff;\n      color: #0a0914;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      font-size: 1.1rem;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      border: none;\n      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);\n      transition: all 0.2s;\n    }\n\n    .btn-play-pause:hover {\n      transform: scale(1.08);\n      background: var(--secondary);\n    }\n\n    .player-progress-area {\n      width: 100%;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 0.75rem;\n      font-size: 0.72rem;\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n    }\n\n    .player-progress-bar {\n      flex: 1;\n      height: 5px;\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n      border-radius: 10px;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      position: relative;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n\n    .player-progress-filled {\n      height: 100%;\n      width: 0%;\n      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--primary) 0%, var(--secondary) 100%);\n      border-radius: 10px;\n    }\n\n    .player-options-right {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 1rem;\n      min-width: 180px;\n      justify-content: flex-end;\n    }\n\n    .btn-speed-toggle {\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n      border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);\n      color: #fff;\n      font-size: 0.72rem;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      padding: 3px 8px;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      cursor: pointer;\n    }\n\n    .player-volume-wrapper {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 0.4rem;\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n    }\n\n    .player-volume-slider {\n      width: 70px;\n      accent-color: var(--secondary);\n      cursor: pointer;\n    }\n\n    .btn-close-player {\n      background: none;\n      border: none;\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n      cursor: pointer;\n      font-size: 1rem;\n    }\n\n    .btn-close-player:hover { color: var(--danger); }\n\n    /* FLOATING AI CHATBOT WIDGET */\n    .chat-widget {\n      position: fixed;\n      bottom: 6.5rem;\n      right: 2rem;\n      z-index: 1000;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      align-items: flex-end;\n    }\n\n    .chat-toggle {\n      width: 58px;\n      height: 58px;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary) 0%, #ec4899 100%);\n      box-shadow: 0 8px 25px var(--primary-glow);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      color: white;\n      font-size: 1.4rem;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n      border: none;\n      position: relative;\n    }\n\n    .chat-toggle:hover {\n      transform: scale(1.1) rotate(5deg);\n    }\n\n    .chat-online-dot {\n      width: 12px;\n      height: 12px;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      background: var(--secondary);\n      border: 2px solid var(--bg-dark);\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 0;\n      right: 0;\n    }\n\n    .chat-window {\n      width: 390px;\n      height: 520px;\n      background: rgba(18, 16, 32, 0.96);\n      backdrop-filter: blur(25px);\n      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(25px);\n      border: 1px solid var(--panel-border-hover);\n      border-radius: 24px;\n      box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      margin-bottom: 1rem;\n      transform: translateY(20px) scale(0.9);\n      opacity: 0;\n      pointer-events: none;\n      transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);\n    }\n\n    .chat-window.active {\n      transform: translateY(0) scale(1);\n      opacity: 1;\n      pointer-events: auto;\n    }\n\n    .chat-header {\n      padding: 1rem 1.25rem;\n      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3) 0%, rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.2) 100%);\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--panel-border);\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      align-items: center;\n    }\n\n    .chat-header-info {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 0.6rem;\n    }\n\n    .chat-header-info h4 {\n      font-size: 0.95rem;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      color: #fff;\n    }\n\n    .chat-header-info span {\n      font-size: 0.7rem;\n      color: var(--secondary);\n      font-weight: 700;\n    }\n\n    .chat-header-close {\n      background: none;\n      border: none;\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n      cursor: pointer;\n      font-size: 1.1rem;\n    }\n\n    .chat-header-close:hover { color: #fff; }\n\n    .chat-messages {\n      flex: 1;\n      padding: 1.2rem;\n      overflow-y: auto;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 0.85rem;\n      font-size: 0.82rem;\n    }\n\n    .chat-bubble {\n      max-width: 85%;\n      padding: 0.7rem 0.95rem;\n      border-radius: 14px;\n      line-height: 1.5;\n      word-break: break-word;\n    }\n\n    .chat-bubble.bot {\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);\n      border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);\n      color: #f1f5f9;\n      align-self: flex-start;\n      border-bottom-left-radius: 4px;\n    }\n\n    .chat-bubble.user {\n      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary) 0%, var(--primary-hover) 100%);\n      color: #fff;\n      align-self: flex-end;\n      border-bottom-right-radius: 4px;\n      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px var(--primary-glow);\n    }\n\n    .chat-quick-suggestions {\n      padding: 0.5rem 1rem;\n      display: flex;\n      gap: 0.4rem;\n      overflow-x: auto;\n      border-top: 1px solid var(--panel-border);\n      background: rgba(10, 9, 20, 0.5);\n    }\n\n    .suggestion-chip {\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);\n      border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n      font-size: 0.72rem;\n      padding: 3px 8px;\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      transition: all 0.2s;\n    }\n\n    .suggestion-chip:hover {\n      border-color: var(--primary);\n      color: #fff;\n    }\n\n    .chat-input-area {\n      display: flex;\n      padding: 0.85rem 1rem;\n      border-top: 1px solid var(--panel-border);\n      background: rgba(10, 9, 20, 0.9);\n      gap: 0.6rem;\n    }\n\n    .chat-input {\n      flex: 1;\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\n      border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      padding: 0.65rem 0.9rem;\n      color: #fff;\n      font-size: 0.82rem;\n      outline: none;\n      transition: all 0.25s;\n    }\n\n    .chat-input:focus {\n      border-color: var(--primary);\n      background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06);\n    }\n\n    .chat-send-btn {\n      background: var(--primary);\n      border: none;\n      color: #fff;\n      width: 38px;\n      height: 38px;\n      border-radius: 10px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      transition: all 0.2s;\n    }\n\n    .chat-send-btn:hover {\n      background: var(--primary-hover);\n      transform: scale(1.05);\n    }\n\n    /* MODAL BASE STYLES */\n    .modal-overlay {\n      display: none;\n      position: fixed;\n      inset: 0;\n      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);\n      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n      z-index: 2000;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      padding: 1.5rem;\n      animation: fadeIn 0.25s ease;\n    }\n\n    @keyframes fadeIn {\n      from { opacity: 0; }\n      to { opacity: 1; }\n    }\n\n    .modal-box {\n      background: rgba(20, 18, 35, 0.98);\n      border: 1px solid var(--panel-border-hover);\n      border-radius: 24px;\n      width: 100%;\n      max-width: 600px;\n      max-height: 90vh;\n      overflow-y: auto;\n      box-shadow: 0 25px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n    }\n\n    .modal-header {\n      padding: 1.25rem 1.75rem;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--panel-border);\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      align-items: center;\n    }\n\n    .modal-header h3 {\n      font-size: 1.15rem;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      color: #fff;\n    }\n\n    .modal-close-btn {\n      background: none;\n      border: none;\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n      cursor: pointer;\n      font-size: 1.25rem;\n    }\n\n    .modal-close-btn:hover { color: #fff; }\n\n    .modal-body {\n      padding: 1.75rem;\n    }\n\n    /* FORM ELEMENTS */\n    .form-group {\n      margin-bottom: 1.2rem;\n    }\n\n    .form-group label {\n      display: block;\n      font-size: 0.78rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n      margin-bottom: 0.4rem;\n    }\n\n    .form-control {\n      width: 100%;\n      padding: 0.75rem 1rem;\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);\n      border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      color: #fff;\n      font-size: 0.85rem;\n      outline: none;\n      transition: all 0.25s;\n    }\n\n    .form-control:focus {\n      border-color: var(--primary);\n      background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06);\n    }\n\n    textarea.form-control {\n      resize: vertical;\n      min-height: 80px;\n    }\n\n    .file-dropzone {\n      border: 2px dashed var(--panel-border);\n      border-radius: 14px;\n      padding: 1.5rem;\n      text-align: center;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      transition: all 0.25s;\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);\n    }\n\n    .file-dropzone:hover {\n      border-color: var(--primary);\n      background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.05);\n    }\n\n    .file-dropzone i {\n      font-size: 2rem;\n      color: var(--primary);\n      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n    }\n\n    .file-dropzone p {\n      font-size: 0.8rem;\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n    }\n\n    .file-dropzone span {\n      font-size: 0.72rem;\n      color: var(--secondary);\n      font-weight: 700;\n    }\n\n    .btn-submit-modal {\n      width: 100%;\n      padding: 0.85rem;\n      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary) 0%, var(--primary-hover) 100%);\n      color: #fff;\n      border: none;\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      font-size: 0.9rem;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px var(--primary-glow);\n      transition: all 0.25s;\n      margin-top: 0.5rem;\n    }\n\n    .btn-submit-modal:hover {\n      transform: translateY(-2px);\n      box-shadow: 0 8px 25px var(--primary-glow);\n    }\n\n    /* READER MODAL */\n    .reader-modal-box {\n      max-width: 1000px;\n      height: 90vh;\n    }\n\n    .reader-tabs {\n      display: flex;\n      gap: 0.5rem;\n    }\n\n    .reader-tab-btn {\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\n      border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n      font-size: 0.78rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      padding: 0.4rem 0.9rem;\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      cursor: pointer;\n    }\n\n    .reader-tab-btn.active {\n      background: var(--secondary);\n      color: #0a0914;\n      border-color: var(--secondary);\n    }\n\n    .reader-content-frame {\n      flex: 1;\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 100%;\n      border: none;\n    }\n\n    .reader-text-container {\n      display: none;\n      flex: 1;\n      overflow-y: auto;\n      padding: 2rem;\n      line-height: 1.8;\n      font-size: 1.05rem;\n      color: #e2e8f0;\n      white-space: pre-wrap;\n    }\n\n    /* TOAST ALERTS */\n    .toast-container {\n      position: fixed;\n      top: 1.5rem;\n      right: 1.5rem;\n      z-index: 3000;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 0.75rem;\n      pointer-events: none;\n    }\n\n    .toast {\n      pointer-events: auto;\n      min-width: 280px;\n      max-width: 380px;\n      padding: 0.85rem 1.25rem;\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      background: rgba(20, 18, 35, 0.96);\n      border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);\n      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 0.75rem;\n      font-size: 0.82rem;\n      animation: toastSlideIn 0.3s ease;\n    }\n\n    @keyframes toastSlideIn {\n      from { transform: translateX(100%); opacity: 0; }\n      to { transform: translateX(0); opacity: 1; }\n    }\n\n    .toast.success { border-color: var(--success); color: #34d399; }\n    .toast.error { border-color: var(--danger); color: #f87171; }\n    .toast.info { border-color: var(--primary); color: #c4b5fd; }\n\n    /* AUTH MODAL TABS */\n    .auth-tab-row {\n      display: flex;\n      gap: 0.5rem;\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);\n      padding: 4px;\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n    }\n\n    .auth-tab-btn {\n      flex: 1;\n      padding: 0.55rem;\n      background: none;\n      border: none;\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n      font-size: 0.82rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      cursor: pointer;\n    }\n\n    .auth-tab-btn.active {\n      background: var(--primary);\n      color: #fff;\n    }\n\n    /* RESPONSIVE BREAKPOINTS */\n    @media (max-width: 768px) {\n      header { padding: 0.85rem 1rem; }\n      .header-search { display: none; }\n      .books-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n      .audio-player-bar {\n        flex-direction: column;\n        padding: 0.85rem 1rem;\n        gap: 0.75rem;\n      }\n      .player-track-info { max-width: 100%; width: 100%; }\n      .player-options-right { display: none; }\n      .chat-window { width: calc(100vw - 2rem); right: 1rem; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <!-- TOAST NOTIFICATION CONTAINER -->\n  <div class=\"toast-container\" id=\"toastContainer\"></div>\n\n  <!-- NAVIGATION HEADER -->\n  <header>\n    <a href=\"/\" class=\"brand\">\n      <div class=\"brand-logo-icon\">\n        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-graduation-cap\"></i>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"brand-text\">\n        <h1>SmartLibrary</h1>\n        <span>AI & Audio Kutubxona</span>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n\n    <!-- SEARCH BAR -->\n    <div class=\"header-search\">\n      <i class=\"fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass\"></i>\n      <input type=\"text\" id=\"searchInput\" placeholder=\"Kitob, muallif yoki janr qidiring...\" oninput=\"handleSearch()\">\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- ACTIONS / USER BADGE -->\n    <div class=\"header-actions\">\n      <!-- Unauthenticated State -->\n      <button class=\"btn-nav btn-nav-primary\" id=\"btnOpenAuth\" onclick=\"openAuthModal('login')\">\n        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-right-to-bracket\"></i> Kirish\n      </button>\n\n      <!-- Authenticated State -->\n      <div class=\"user-pill\" id=\"userPill\" style=\"display: none;\">\n        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-user-circle\" style=\"color: var(--primary); font-size: 1.1rem;\"></i>\n        <span id=\"headerUsername\" style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Foydalanuvchi</span>\n        <span class=\"user-role-badge user\" id=\"headerRoleBadge\">Kitobxon</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <button class=\"btn-nav btn-nav-secondary\" id=\"btnLogout\" style=\"display: none;\" onclick=\"logout()\">\n        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-right-from-bracket\"></i> Chiqish\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <!-- MAIN VIEW -->\n  <main class=\"main-container\">\n\n    <!-- HERO METRICS -->\n    <section class=\"hero-stats-grid\">\n      <div class=\"stat-card\">\n        <div class=\"stat-icon books\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-book\"></i></div>\n        <div class=\"stat-data\">\n          <h3 id=\"statTotalBooks\">0</h3>\n          <p>Kutubxona fondi</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stat-card\">\n        <div class=\"stat-icon audio\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-headphones\"></i></div>\n        <div class=\"stat-data\">\n          <h3 id=\"statTotalAudio\">0</h3>\n          <p>Audio kitoblar</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stat-card\">\n        <div class=\"stat-icon genres\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-shapes\"></i></div>\n        <div class=\"stat-data\">\n          <h3 id=\"statTotalGenres\">0</h3>\n          <p>Turkum & Janrlar</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stat-card\">\n        <div class=\"stat-icon ai\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-wand-magic-sparkles\"></i></div>\n        <div class=\"stat-data\">\n          <h3>24/7 AI</h3>\n          <p>Kutubxonachi faol</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ADMIN ACTION TOOLBAR (ONLY FOR ADMIN) -->\n    <section class=\"admin-toolbar\" id=\"adminToolbar\">\n      <div class=\"admin-toolbar-title\">\n        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-shield-halved\"></i>\n        <span>Admin Boshqaruv Paneli (Faqat Admin huquqi)</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"admin-toolbar-btns\">\n        <button class=\"btn-nav btn-nav-primary\" onclick=\"openAddBookModal()\">\n          <i class=\"fa-solid fa-plus\"></i> Yangi Kitob Qo'shish\n        </button>\n        <button class=\"btn-nav btn-nav-secondary\" onclick=\"document.getElementById('quickPdfInput').click()\">\n          <i class=\"fa-solid fa-file-pdf\" style=\"color:#f87171;\"></i> PDF Yuklash\n        </button>\n        <button class=\"btn-nav btn-nav-secondary\" onclick=\"document.getElementById('quickZipInput').click()\">\n          <i class=\"fa-solid fa-file-zipper\" style=\"color:var(--secondary);\"></i> ZIP Arxiv\n        </button>\n        <input type=\"file\" id=\"quickPdfInput\" accept=\".pdf\" style=\"display:none;\" onchange=\"handleQuickUpload(this, 'pdf')\">\n        <input type=\"file\" id=\"quickZipInput\" accept=\".zip\" style=\"display:none;\" onchange=\"handleQuickUpload(this, 'zip')\">\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- GENRE FILTER & AUDIO TOGGLE -->\n    <div class=\"filter-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"genre-pills\" id=\"genrePillsContainer\">\n        <button class=\"genre-pill active\" onclick=\"filterByGenre('all', this)\">Barchasi</button>\n      </div>\n\n      <button class=\"audio-filter-toggle\" id=\"audioFilterToggle\" onclick=\"toggleAudioOnlyFilter()\">\n        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-headphones\"></i> Faqat Audio Kitoblar\n      </button>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- BOOKS SECTION TITLE -->\n    <div class=\"books-section-title\">\n      <span id=\"catalogCountText\">Barcha Kitoblar</span>\n      <span style=\"font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 500;\" id=\"searchResultFeedback\"></span>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- BOOKS GRID -->\n    <div class=\"books-grid\" id=\"booksGrid\">\n      <!-- Injected via JavaScript -->\n    </div>\n\n  </main>\n\n  <!-- PERSISTENT BOTTOM AUDIO PLAYER BAR -->\n  <div class=\"audio-player-bar\" id=\"audioPlayerBar\">\n    <!-- Hidden native audio element -->\n    <audio id=\"nativeAudioPlayer\" preload=\"auto\"></audio>\n\n    <div class=\"player-track-info\">\n      <div class=\"player-cover\">\n        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-headphones\"></i>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"player-titles\">\n        <h4 id=\"playerBookTitle\">Kitob Nomi</h4>\n        <p id=\"playerBookAuthor\">Muallif Nomi</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"player-controls-center\">\n      <div class=\"player-buttons\">\n        <button class=\"btn-player-ctrl\" onclick=\"seekAudio(-10)\" title=\"10 soniya orqaga\">\n          <i class=\"fa-solid fa-rotate-left\"></i> 10s\n        </button>\n        <button class=\"btn-play-pause\" id=\"btnPlayPause\" onclick=\"togglePlayPause()\">\n          <i class=\"fa-solid fa-play\" id=\"playPauseIcon\"></i>\n        </button>\n        <button class=\"btn-player-ctrl\" onclick=\"seekAudio(10)\" title=\"10 soniya oldinga\">\n          10s <i class=\"fa-solid fa-rotate-right\"></i>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"player-progress-area\">\n        <span id=\"playerCurrentTime\">00:00</span>\n        <div class=\"player-progress-bar\" id=\"playerProgressBar\" onclick=\"handleSeekbarClick(event)\">\n          <div class=\"player-progress-filled\" id=\"playerProgressFilled\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <span id=\"playerDuration\">00:00</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"player-options-right\">\n      <button class=\"btn-speed-toggle\" id=\"btnPlaybackRate\" onclick=\"cyclePlaybackRate()\">1.0x</button>\n      <div class=\"player-volume-wrapper\">\n        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-volume-high\" id=\"playerVolumeIcon\" onclick=\"toggleMute()\"></i>\n        <input type=\"range\" class=\"player-volume-slider\" id=\"playerVolumeSlider\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"1\" oninput=\"setVolume(this.value)\">\n      </div>\n      <button class=\"btn-close-player\" onclick=\"closeAudioPlayer()\" title=\"Yopish\">\n        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-xmark\"></i>\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- FLOATING AI CHATBOT WIDGET -->\n  <div class=\"chat-widget\">\n    <div class=\"chat-window\" id=\"chatWindow\">\n      <div class=\"chat-header\">\n        <div class=\"chat-header-info\">\n          <i class=\"fa-solid fa-robot\" style=\"color: var(--secondary); font-size: 1.2rem;\"></i>\n          <div>\n            <h4>AI Kutubxonachi</h4>\n            <span>Doimo faol • Barcha kitoblar bilimdoni</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <button class=\"chat-header-close\" onclick=\"toggleChat()\">\n          <i class=\"fa-solid fa-xmark\"></i>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"chat-messages\" id=\"chatMessages\">\n        <div class=\"chat-bubble bot\">\n          Assalomu alaykum! Men <b>Aqlli Kutubxona</b>ning AI maslahatchisiman. Istalgan kitob, muallif, asar syujeti yoki kutubxona statistikasi haqida savol bering!\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- QUICK SUGGESTIONS -->\n      <div class=\"chat-quick-suggestions\">\n        <span class=\"suggestion-chip\" onclick=\"askQuickPrompt('Kutubxonada nechta kitob bor?')\">📚 Kitoblar soni</span>\n        <span class=\"suggestion-chip\" onclick=\"askQuickPrompt('Qaysi audio kitoblar bor?')\">🎧 Audio kitoblar</span>\n        <span class=\"suggestion-chip\" onclick=\"askQuickPrompt('Garri Potter haqida aytib ber')\">🧙 Garri Potter</span>\n        <span class=\"suggestion-chip\" onclick=\"askQuickPrompt('Alkimyogar qanday kitob?')\">✨ Alkimyogar</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"chat-input-area\">\n        <input type=\"text\" id=\"chatInput\" class=\"chat-input\" placeholder=\"Savolingizni yozing...\" onkeypress=\"handleChatKeyPress(event)\">\n        <button class=\"chat-send-btn\" onclick=\"sendMessage()\">\n          <i class=\"fa-solid fa-paper-plane\"></i>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <button class=\"chat-toggle\" onclick=\"toggleChat()\" title=\"AI Kutubxonachi bilan suhbat\">\n      <div class=\"chat-online-dot\"></div>\n      <i class=\"fa-solid fa-comments\"></i>\n    </button>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- MODAL: AUTHENTICATION (LOGIN / REGISTER) -->\n  <div class=\"modal-overlay\" id=\"authModal\">\n    <div class=\"modal-box\" style=\"max-width: 440px;\">\n      <div class=\"modal-header\">\n        <h3 id=\"authModalTitle\">Tizimga Kirish</h3>\n        <button class=\"modal-close-btn\" onclick=\"closeAuthModal()\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-xmark\"></i></button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"modal-body\">\n        <div class=\"auth-tab-row\">\n          <button class=\"auth-tab-btn active\" id=\"tabAuthLogin\" onclick=\"switchAuthTab('login')\">Kirish</button>\n          <button class=\"auth-tab-btn\" id=\"tabAuthRegister\" onclick=\"switchAuthTab('register')\">Ro'yxatdan o'tish</button>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- LOGIN FORM -->\n        <form id=\"formLogin\" onsubmit=\"handleLoginSubmit(event)\">\n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label for=\"loginEmail\">Email Manzil</label>\n            <input type=\"email\" id=\"loginEmail\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"nomi@domain.com\" required>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label for=\"loginPassword\">Parol</label>\n            <input type=\"password\" id=\"loginPassword\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"••••••••\" required>\n          </div>\n          <p style=\"font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 1rem;\">\n            💡 Admin: <code>admin@library.com</code> / <code>admin123</code><br>\n            💡 Kitobxon: <code>user@library.com</code> / <code>user123</code>\n          </p>\n          <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-submit-modal\" id=\"btnLoginSubmit\">Tizimga Kirish</button>\n        </form>\n\n        <!-- REGISTER FORM -->\n        <form id=\"formRegister\" style=\"display:none;\" onsubmit=\"handleRegisterSubmit(event)\">\n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label for=\"regEmail\">Email Manzil</label>\n            <input type=\"email\" id=\"regEmail\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"nomi@domain.com\" required>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label for=\"regUsername\">Foydalanuvchi Nomi</label>\n            <input type=\"text\" id=\"regUsername\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"alisher99\" required>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label for=\"regPassword\">Parol (Kamida 6 belgi)</label>\n            <input type=\"password\" id=\"regPassword\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"••••••••\" minlength=\"6\" required>\n          </div>\n          <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-submit-modal\" id=\"btnRegisterSubmit\">Ro'yxatdan O'tish</button>\n        </form>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- MODAL: ADD BOOK (ADMIN ONLY) -->\n  <div class=\"modal-overlay\" id=\"addBookModal\">\n    <div class=\"modal-box\">\n      <div class=\"modal-header\">\n        <h3><i class=\"fa-solid fa-plus-circle\" style=\"color:var(--primary);\"></i> Yangi Kitob Qo'shish</h3>\n        <button class=\"modal-close-btn\" onclick=\"closeAddBookModal()\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-xmark\"></i></button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"modal-body\">\n        <form id=\"formAddBook\" onsubmit=\"handleAddBookSubmit(event)\">\n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label>Kitob Nomi *</label>\n            <input type=\"text\" id=\"newBookTitle\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"Masalan: O'tkan kunlar\" required>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label>Muallif</label>\n            <input type=\"text\" id=\"newBookAuthor\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"Masalan: Abdulla Qodiriy\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label>Janr</label>\n            <input type=\"text\" id=\"newBookGenre\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"Masalan: Tarixiy Roman\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label>Qisqacha Tavsif</label>\n            <textarea id=\"newBookDesc\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"Asar haqida qisqacha ma'lumot...\"></textarea>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label>PDF Fayli (.pdf)</label>\n            <input type=\"file\" id=\"newBookPdf\" accept=\".pdf\" class=\"form-control\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label>Audio Kitob Fayli (.mp3, .wav, .m4a)</label>\n            <input type=\"file\" id=\"newBookAudio\" accept=\"audio/*,.mp3,.wav,.m4a,.ogg\" class=\"form-control\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label>Yoki Onlayn Audio Havola (URL)</label>\n            <input type=\"url\" id=\"newBookAudioUrl\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"https://.../audio.mp3\">\n          </div>\n          <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-submit-modal\" id=\"btnSaveBook\">Kitobni Saqlash</button>\n        </form>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- MODAL: UPLOAD AUDIO FOR EXISTING BOOK (ADMIN ONLY) -->\n  <div class=\"modal-overlay\" id=\"uploadAudioModal\">\n    <div class=\"modal-box\" style=\"max-width: 480px;\">\n      <div class=\"modal-header\">\n        <h3><i class=\"fa-solid fa-headphones\" style=\"color:var(--secondary);\"></i> Audio Kitob Biriktirish</h3>\n        <button class=\"modal-close-btn\" onclick=\"closeUploadAudioModal()\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-xmark\"></i></button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"modal-body\">\n        <p style=\"font-size: 0.85rem; color: #cbd5e1; margin-bottom: 1rem;\">\n          Kitob: <b id=\"audioTargetBookTitle\" style=\"color:#fff;\">-</b>\n        </p>\n        <form id=\"formUploadAudio\" onsubmit=\"handleAudioUploadSubmit(event)\">\n          <input type=\"hidden\" id=\"audioTargetBookId\">\n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label>Audio Faylni Tanlang (.mp3, .wav, .m4a, .ogg)</label>\n            <input type=\"file\" id=\"audioUploadFile\" accept=\"audio/*,.mp3,.wav,.m4a,.ogg,.aac\" class=\"form-control\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label>Yoki Audio Havola (URL)</label>\n            <input type=\"url\" id=\"audioUploadUrl\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"https://.../audio.mp3\">\n          </div>\n          <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-submit-modal\" id=\"btnSaveAudio\">Audio Kitobni Saqlash</button>\n        </form>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- MODAL: READER (PDF & TEXT VIEW) -->\n  <div class=\"modal-overlay\" id=\"readerModal\">\n    <div class=\"modal-box reader-modal-box\">\n      <div class=\"modal-header\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:1rem;\">\n          <h3 id=\"readerBookTitle\" style=\"color:var(--secondary); font-size: 1rem;\">Kitobni O'qish</h3>\n          <div class=\"reader-tabs\">\n            <button class=\"reader-tab-btn active\" id=\"btnTabPdf\" onclick=\"switchReaderTab('pdf')\">PDF Ko'rish</button>\n            <button class=\"reader-tab-btn\" id=\"btnTabText\" onclick=\"switchReaderTab('text')\">Matn Rejimi</button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <button class=\"modal-close-btn\" onclick=\"closeReaderModal()\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-xmark\"></i></button>\n      </div>\n      <iframe id=\"readerPdfFrame\" class=\"reader-content-frame\"></iframe>\n      <div id=\"readerTextContainer\" class=\"reader-text-container\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- JAVASCRIPT LOGIC -->\n  <script>\n    // GLOBAL STATE\n    let allBooks = [];\n    let currentFilterGenre = 'all';\n    let filterAudioOnly = false;\n    let currentUser = null;\n    let currentPlaybackRate = 1.0;\n    const playbackRates = [0.75, 1.0, 1.25, 1.5, 2.0];\n\n    const nativeAudio = document.getElementById('nativeAudioPlayer');\n\n    // INITIALIZATION\n    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n      checkAuth();\n      loadBooks();\n      setupAudioPlayerEvents();\n    });\n\n    // TOAST NOTIFICATIONS\n    function showToast(message, type = 'info') {\n      const container = document.getElementById('toastContainer');\n      const toast = document.createElement('div');\n      toast.className = `toast ${type}`;\n      \n      const icons = {\n        success: 'fa-circle-check',\n        error: 'fa-circle-exclamation',\n        info: 'fa-circle-info'\n      };\n      \n      toast.innerHTML = `<i class=\"fa-solid ${icons[type] || 'fa-circle-info'}\"></i> <span>${message}</span>`;\n      container.appendChild(toast);\n\n      setTimeout(() => {\n        toast.style.opacity = '0';\n        toast.style.transform = 'translateX(100%)';\n        toast.style.transition = 'all 0.3s ease';\n        setTimeout(() => toast.remove(), 300);\n      }, 4000);\n    }\n\n    // AUTHENTICATION & USER STATE\n    async function checkAuth() {\n      const token = localStorage.getItem('access_token');\n      const btnOpenAuth = document.getElementById('btnOpenAuth');\n      const userPill = document.getElementById('userPill');\n      const btnLogout = document.getElementById('btnLogout');\n      const adminToolbar = document.getElementById('adminToolbar');\n\n      if (!token) {\n        currentUser = null;\n        btnOpenAuth.style.display = 'inline-flex';\n        userPill.style.display = 'none';\n        btnLogout.style.display = 'none';\n        adminToolbar.style.display = 'none';\n        renderBooks();\n        return;\n      }\n\n      try {\n        const res = await fetch('/api/auth/me/', {\n          headers: { 'Authorization': 'Bearer ' + token }\n        });\n        if (res.ok) {\n          currentUser = await res.json();\n          const isAdmin = currentUser.is_staff || currentUser.is_superuser;\n          \n          btnOpenAuth.style.display = 'none';\n          userPill.style.display = 'flex';\n          btnLogout.style.display = 'inline-flex';\n          \n          document.getElementById('headerUsername').innerText = currentUser.username || currentUser.email.split('@')[0];\n          const roleBadge = document.getElementById('headerRoleBadge');\n          \n          if (isAdmin) {\n            roleBadge.innerText = 'Admin';\n            roleBadge.className = 'user-role-badge admin';\n            adminToolbar.style.display = 'flex';\n          } else {\n            roleBadge.innerText = 'Kitobxon';\n            roleBadge.className = 'user-role-badge user';\n            adminToolbar.style.display = 'none';\n          }\n          renderBooks();\n        } else {\n          logout();\n        }\n      } catch (e) {\n        console.error(\"Auth check failed:\", e);\n      }\n    }\n\n    function logout() {\n      localStorage.removeItem('access_token');\n      localStorage.removeItem('refresh_token');\n      currentUser = null;\n      showToast(\"Tizimdan chiqildi.\", 'info');\n      checkAuth();\n    }\n\n    function openAuthModal(tab = 'login') {\n      switchAuthTab(tab);\n      document.getElementById('authModal').style.display = 'flex';\n    }\n\n    function closeAuthModal() {\n      document.getElementById('authModal').style.display = 'none';\n    }\n\n    function switchAuthTab(tab) {\n      const tabLogin = document.getElementById('tabAuthLogin');\n      const tabRegister = document.getElementById('tabAuthRegister');\n      const formLogin = document.getElementById('formLogin');\n      const formRegister = document.getElementById('formRegister');\n      const title = document.getElementById('authModalTitle');\n\n      if (tab === 'login') {\n        tabLogin.classList.add('active');\n        tabRegister.classList.remove('active');\n        formLogin.style.display = 'block';\n        formRegister.style.display = 'none';\n        title.innerText = \"Tizimga Kirish\";\n      } else {\n        tabRegister.classList.add('active');\n        tabLogin.classList.remove('active');\n        formLogin.style.display = 'none';\n        formRegister.style.display = 'block';\n        title.innerText = \"Ro'yxatdan O'tish\";\n      }\n    }\n\n    async function handleLoginSubmit(e) {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      const email = document.getElementById('loginEmail').value.trim();\n      const password = document.getElementById('loginPassword').value;\n      const btn = document.getElementById('btnLoginSubmit');\n      btn.disabled = true;\n      btn.innerText = \"Kirilmoqda...\";\n\n      try {\n        const res = await fetch('/api/auth/login/', {\n          method: 'POST',\n          headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\n          body: JSON.stringify({ email, password })\n        });\n        const data = await res.json();\n        if (res.ok) {\n          localStorage.setItem('access_token', data.access);\n          localStorage.setItem('refresh_token', data.refresh);\n          showToast(\"Xush kelibsiz! Tizimga muvaffaqiyatli kirildi.\", 'success');\n          closeAuthModal();\n          await checkAuth();\n        } else {\n          showToast(data.detail || \"Email yoki parol xato kiritildi.\", 'error');\n        }\n      } catch (err) {\n        showToast(\"Server bilan bog'lanishda xatolik yuz berdi.\", 'error');\n      } finally {\n        btn.disabled = false;\n        btn.innerText = \"Tizimga Kirish\";\n      }\n    }\n\n    async function handleRegisterSubmit(e) {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      const email = document.getElementById('regEmail').value.trim();\n      const username = document.getElementById('regUsername').value.trim();\n      const password = document.getElementById('regPassword').value;\n      const btn = document.getElementById('btnRegisterSubmit');\n      btn.disabled = true;\n      btn.innerText = \"Yaratilmoqda...\";\n\n      try {\n        const res = await fetch('/api/auth/register/', {\n          method: 'POST',\n          headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\n          body: JSON.stringify({ email, username, password })\n        });\n        const data = await res.json();\n        if (res.ok) {\n          showToast(\"Hisob yaratildi! Kirilmoqda...\", 'success');\n          // Auto login\n          const logRes = await fetch('/api/auth/login/', {\n            method: 'POST',\n            headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\n            body: JSON.stringify({ email, password })\n          });\n          const logData = await logRes.json();\n          if (logRes.ok) {\n            localStorage.setItem('access_token', logData.access);\n            localStorage.setItem('refresh_token', logData.refresh);\n            closeAuthModal();\n            await checkAuth();\n          } else {\n            switchAuthTab('login');\n          }\n        } else {\n          const err = data.email ? data.email[0] : (data.detail || \"Ro'yxatdan o'tishda xatolik.\");\n          showToast(err, 'error');\n        }\n      } catch (err) {\n        showToast(\"Server bilan bog'lanishda xatolik.\", 'error');\n      } finally {\n        btn.disabled = false;\n        btn.innerText = \"Ro'yxatdan O'tish\";\n      }\n    }\n\n    // BOOKS DATA FETCHING & RENDERING\n    async function loadBooks() {\n      try {\n        const token = localStorage.getItem('access_token');\n        const headers = token ? { 'Authorization': 'Bearer ' + token } : {};\n        const res = await fetch('/api/books/', { headers });\n        if (res.ok) {\n          allBooks = await res.json();\n          updateMetrics();\n          renderGenrePills();\n          renderBooks();\n        }\n      } catch (err) {\n        console.error(\"Books loading error:\", err);\n      }\n    }\n\n    function updateMetrics() {\n      document.getElementById('statTotalBooks').innerText = allBooks.length;\n      const audioCount = allBooks.filter(b => b.has_audio || b.audio_file || b.audiobook_url).length;\n      document.getElementById('statTotalAudio').innerText = audioCount;\n\n      const genresSet = new Set(allBooks.map(b => b.genre).filter(Boolean));\n      document.getElementById('statTotalGenres').innerText = genresSet.size;\n    }\n\n    function renderGenrePills() {\n      const container = document.getElementById('genrePillsContainer');\n      const genresSet = new Set(allBooks.map(b => b.genre).filter(Boolean));\n      \n      let html = `<button class=\"genre-pill ${currentFilterGenre === 'all' ? 'active' : ''}\" onclick=\"filterByGenre('all', this)\">Barchasi</button>`;\n      genresSet.forEach(genre => {\n        html += `<button class=\"genre-pill ${currentFilterGenre === genre ? 'active' : ''}\" onclick=\"filterByGenre('${genre}', this)\">${genre}</button>`;\n      });\n      container.innerHTML = html;\n    }\n\n    function filterByGenre(genre, btn) {\n      currentFilterGenre = genre;\n      document.querySelectorAll('.genre-pill').forEach(p => p.classList.remove('active'));\n      if (btn) btn.classList.add('active');\n      renderBooks();\n    }\n\n    function toggleAudioOnlyFilter() {\n      filterAudioOnly = !filterAudioOnly;\n      const btn = document.getElementById('audioFilterToggle');\n      if (filterAudioOnly) {\n        btn.classList.add('active');\n      } else {\n        btn.classList.remove('active');\n      }\n      renderBooks();\n    }\n\n    function handleSearch() {\n      renderBooks();\n    }\n\n    function renderBooks() {\n      const grid = document.getElementById('booksGrid');\n      const searchQuery = document.getElementById('searchInput').value.trim().toLowerCase();\n      const isAdmin = currentUser && (currentUser.is_staff || currentUser.is_superuser);\n\n      let filtered = allBooks.filter(b => {\n        const matchGenre = currentFilterGenre === 'all' || b.genre === currentFilterGenre;\n        const hasAudio = Boolean(b.has_audio || b.audio_file || b.audiobook_url);\n        const matchAudio = !filterAudioOnly || hasAudio;\n        const matchSearch = !searchQuery || \n          (b.title && b.title.toLowerCase().includes(searchQuery)) ||\n          (b.author && b.author.toLowerCase().includes(searchQuery)) ||\n          (b.genre && b.genre.toLowerCase().includes(searchQuery)) ||\n          (b.description && b.description.toLowerCase().includes(searchQuery));\n        return matchGenre && matchAudio && matchSearch;\n      });\n\n      document.getElementById('catalogCountText').innerText = `Mavjud Kitoblar (${filtered.length} ta)`;\n\n      if (filtered.length === 0) {\n        grid.innerHTML = `\n          <div style=\"grid-column: 1/-1; text-align: center; padding: 3rem; color: var(--text-muted);\">\n            <i class=\"fa-solid fa-book-open\" style=\"font-size: 3rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; opacity: 0.5;\"></i>\n            <h3>Hech qanday kitob topilmadi</h3>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 0.5rem;\">Qidiruv yoki filtrlarni o'zgartirib ko'ring.</p>\n          </div>\n        `;\n        return;